# MANDATORY: MCTB PAGE BUILD SPEC — 08: PHONE & FORWARDING

**Route:** `/mctb/setup/phone` | **Wizard:** Setup Step 1 (spec 07)  
**Source of truth:** `docs/TRANSOVO-MCTB-PAGE-BUILD-SPEC-08-PHONE-FORWARDING.md`  
**Prerequisites:** Governing MCTB docs + specs 01–07

## When this rule activates

**Before implementing, restyling, or declaring complete** MCTB Phone & Forwarding (`/mctb/setup/phone`, wizard phone step, legacy `/voice/setup` forwarding).

## Primary job

Connect customer's **existing public business line** to MCTB via **conditional carrier forwarding** to hidden **toll-free Transovo ingress** — then **verify with real evidence**.

Not: SMS sender config, consent, PBX, Smart Routing, SIP troubleshooting, replacing business number.

## Three number roles (LOCKED — never conflate)

| Role | What |
|------|------|
| **Business line** | Customer's public number customers call |
| **Forwarding destination** | Hidden toll-free ingress (workspace-assigned, not hardcoded) |
| **Text-back sender** | SMS sender — separate; link only, do not configure here |

## Flows

**Wizard Step 1:** Business line → carrier → setup method → instructions → I've turned it on → verification → Verified → Continue

**Post-setup editor:** Direct access, no wizard progress — status, instructions, re-verify, troubleshoot

## Carrier guides

- **One canonical source** (forwarding-guides dataset) — wizard, editor, diagnostics share it
- Preserve existing Smith.ai-based approved content; **never fabricate codes**
- Two presentation modes: **Walk me through it** | **Show me the instructions**
- Missing carrier: show destination + generic conditional-forwarding language + verification (no fake steps)

## Verification (LOCKED)

- "I've turned it on" ≠ Verified
- Test: call **public business line** from another phone, let ring unanswered
- Server-authoritative evidence — not `testPassed=true` from client
- Checkpoints: call reached, workspace/line matched, caller ID preserved (where supported)
- Partial failures stay specific; retry does not wipe config
- Server-side session survives mobile backgrounding

## Architecture

- **Toll-free ingress** — do not reopen local DID / SIP / PRACK experiments
- Pause MCTB ≠ disable carrier forwarding
- Changing business line or carrier invalidates applicable verification

## Prohibited

Hardcoded forwarding numbers, mock verification, fake progress %, calling hidden ingress for production test, duplicate guide implementations, telephony jargon in normal UI

## Definition of done

See full spec §101 checklist.

